35,2,1,talk,Mio,,"Transport costs vary wildly depending on distance. Also, some people never even show up.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"It seems the evenings are key for bonding, but many members are dropping out entirely.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Public bookings are a nightmare of paperwork, and cooking for ourselves is a huge time sink.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,"Public beds are cheap, but other clubs said the rooms are crowded and sleep is restricted.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Misaki,,Non-refundable deposits for whole buildings are risky if people cancel at the last minute.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Misaki, if transport is the biggest cost, maybe staying local is the safest bet?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"But if we stay local, will we actually spend those important evenings together?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,Staying local might save the organizers from a mountain of paperwork and cooking.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"If we go inland, we might end up exhausted from poor sleep again.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"Local is cheaper, but we have to be sure about the facility availability.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,I'm worried about the cost gap if we go too far.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"I feel a coastal lodge might be a nice change, but is it too risky?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,A public center sounds like too much work for the staff.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,I'm leaning away from the inland center if the sleep quality is that bad.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Misaki,,The financial risk of a private lodge is high given the attendance trends.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
